./deep-research-report.md:121:`LITERATURE-SUPPORTED PRINCIPLE`　Monderer 與 Shapley，*Potential Games*，*Games and Economic Behavior* 14(1), 1996，[DOI 10.1006/game.1996.0044](https://doi.org/10.1006/game.1996.0044)，要求 exact potential 在**相同 \(a_{-u}\)** 下，player \(u\) 的 unilateral utility difference 等於一個共同 potential 的 difference。citeturn13search2 Marden、Arslan、Shamma，*Cooperative Control and Potential Games*，IEEE TSMC-B 2009，[DOI 10.1109/TSMCB.2009.2017273](https://doi.org/10.1109/TSMCB.2009.2017273)，以及 Nie、Comaniciu 在 wireless channel allocation 中的 *Adaptive Channel Allocation Spectrum Etiquette for Cognitive Radio Networks*，*Mobile Networks and Applications* 2006，[DOI 10.1007/s11036-006-0049-y](https://doi.org/10.1007/s11036-006-0049-y)，都是**先構造滿足 potential 結構的 utilities** 才得到分散式性質；不能由「shared cost 剛好可守恆」反推 potential。citeturn12view9turn12view10
